	quest.29B54FAB02DE3E0D.quest_desc: [
		"Grab a multiple of &3100mb of Copper&r, put it into the &3Vessel&r (depending on the count of items you want to make). Put the &3Vessel&r into the &3Pit Kiln&r, fill and fire it up!"
		""
		"Don't forget about a pit! Molten metal will lose it's temperature with time after the pit goes out. So, grab the &3Vessel&r as soon as the pit is done, open it's interface via RMB. Place any &3Fired Mold&r in the Vessel slot and watch the metal flow!"
		""
		"Congrats, now you have your &cfirst pickaxe&r!"
		""
		"&8TIP: if you want to proceed with Bronze tools - you can just melt the pickaxe or it's head alone to get your 100mb of Copper back.&r"
	]
