	quest.6F53637B21404A79.title: "Black Steel Anvil"
	quest.6FE2992AEE98301E.quest_desc: [
		"To make &3Charcoal&r simply gather a lot of &3Logs&r. Then dig a pit. Shift-right-click with &3Logs&r into the pit. Make sure all &3Piles&r are holding &316 Logs&r each. It will affect &3Charcoal&r output. Then cover the pit with dirt, leaving one &3Pile&r visible to you. Use a &3Firestarter&r on it. When the fire has started cover the last &3Pile&r with dirt."
		""
		"Wait some time until dirt goes down. You will find &3Charcoal Piles&r there. Use a hand or a shovel to collect it."
		""
		"See &5TFC Guidebook: Advanced Mechanics: Charcoal Pit&r for more."
	]
	quest.6FE2992AEE98301E.title: "Charcoal"
