	quest.76142216D24338FE.quest_desc: [
		"Now get a few of those &3Copper Double Ingots&f and craft them into an actual anvil."
		"It allows you to forge copper tools directly from heated ingots, without casting metal, and to create components of &3Bloomery&f, your first ore processing station."
	]
